first to resettle their own property in their cities were Israelites, priests, Levites, and temple servants.","from":18}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"19-34":{"people":[{"id":"korah-h7141i","name":"Korah","kind":"person","brief":"Aaron's adversary","count":2,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"shallum-h7967m","name":"Shallum","kind":"person","brief":"Temple official","count":2,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"ebiasaph-h0043","name":"Ebiasaph","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Korah","count":1,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"kore-h6981g","name":"Kore","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Ebiasaph","count":1,"firstVerse":19},{"id":"eleazar-h0499g","name":"Eleazar","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"phinehas-h6372g","name":"Phinehas","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"meshelemiah-h4920","name":"Meshelemiah","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Zechariah","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"zechariah-h2148a","name":"Zechariah","kind":"person","brief":"A Singer","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"samuel-h8050g","name":"Samuel","kind":"person","brief":"Prophet and Judge","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":4,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"mattithiah-h4993g","name":"Mattithiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shallum","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"kohath-h6955","name":"Kohath","kind":"person","brief":"Levi's son","count":1,"firstVerse":32}],"places":[{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":34}],"words":[{"base":"H7778","lemma":"שֹׁעֵר","tr":"sho·er","gloss":"gatekeeper","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":37},{"base":"H1992","lemma":"הֵ֫מָּה","tr":"hem·mah","gloss":"they(masc.)","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":552},{"base":"H0530","lemma":"אֱמוּנָה","tr":"e·mu·nah","gloss":"faithfulness","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":49},{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":291},{"base":"H7145","lemma":"קׇרְחִי","tr":"qor·chi","gloss":"Korahite","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":8},{"base":"H0428","lemma":"אֵ֫לֶּה","tr":"el·leh","gloss":"these","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":746},{"base":"H4480","lemma":"מִן־","tr":"min","gloss":"from","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":1187},{"base":"H3627","lemma":"כְּלִי","tr":"ke·li","gloss":"article","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":325},{"base":"H0168","lemma":"אֹ֫הֶל","tr":"o·hel","gloss":"tent","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":345},{"base":"H7967","lemma":"שַׁלּוּם","tr":"shal·lum","gloss":"Shallum","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":27}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2KI","chapter":11,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"and commanded them, “This is what you are to do: A third of you who come on duty on the Sabbath shall guard the royal palace,","from":25},{"book":"LEV","chapter":24,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"You are also to take fine flour and bake twelve loaves, using two-tenths of an ephah for each loaf,","from":32},{"book":"LEV","chapter":24,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"Every Sabbath day the bread is to be set out before the LORD on behalf of the Israelites as a permanent covenant.","from":32},{"book":"1SA","chapter":9,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"(Formerly in Israel, a man on his way to inquire of God would say, “Come, let us go to the seer.” For the prophet of today was formerly called the seer.)","from":22},{"book":"1CH","chapter":6,"verse":31,"verseEnd":31,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"These are the men David put in charge of the music in the house of the LORD after the ark rested there.","from":33},{"book":"1CH","chapter":6,"verse":33,"verseEnd":33,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"These are the men who served, together with their sons. From the Kohathites: Heman the singer, the son of Joel, the son of Samuel,","from":33},{"book":"EXO","chapter":25,"verse":30,"verseEnd":30,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And place the Bread of the Presence on the table before Me at all times.","from":32},{"book":"EXO","chapter":27,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And you are to command the Israelites to bring you pure oil of pressed olives for the light, to keep the lamps burning continually.","from":29}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":3},{"id":"judges-era","title":"Judges era and the road to David","people":2}]},"35-44":{"people":[{"id":"abiel-h0022g","name":"Abiel","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":2,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"maacah-h4601n","name":"Maacah","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":35},{"id":"kish-h7027g","name":"Kish","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's father","count":2,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"abdon-h5658j","name":"Abdon","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"baal-h1168b","name":"Baal","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"nadab-h5070j","name":"Nadab","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abiel","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"ner-h5369g","name":"Ner","kind":"person","brief":"Abner's father","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"zur-h6698i","name":"Zur","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"mikloth-h4732g","name":"Mikloth","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abiel","count":2,"firstVerse":37},{"id":"ahio-h0283i","name":"Ahio","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abiel","count":1,"firstVerse":37},{"id":"gedor-h1446i","name":"Gedor","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":37},{"id":"zecher-h2144","name":"Zecher","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":37},{"id":"shimeah-h8039","name":"Shimeah","kind":"person","brief":"Saul's family","count":1,"firstVerse":38},{"id":"jonathan-h3083h","name